# Shell cwd for this repo

This workspace may include sibling roots. Treat **this repository root** as the only place for npm / Node install commands.

For any command that installs packages or writes lockfiles, use one shell line:

```bash
cd /absolute/path/to/obsidian-plugin-float_toc && pwd && npm <command>
```

Confirm `pwd` prints this repo before the install runs. Prefer `cd` in the command string over relying on Shell `working_directory` alone.
